            </h3>

            <div class="accordion" id="dateTimeQuestions">

                <!-- Q1 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#dateQuestionOne">

                            What is the Java Date and Time API?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionOne"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            The modern Java Date and Time API is provided mainly
                            through the <code>java.time</code> package.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- Q2 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#dateQuestionTwo">

                            What is the difference between LocalDate and LocalDateTime?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionTwo"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            <code>LocalDate</code> contains only a date, while
                            <code>LocalDateTime</code> contains both a date and
                            a time without a time zone.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- Q3 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#dateQuestionThree">

                            What is ZonedDateTime?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionThree"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            <code>ZonedDateTime</code> represents a date and
                            time together with a time zone.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- Q4 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#dateQuestionFour">

                            What is the difference between Period and Duration?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionFour"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            <code>Period</code> represents date-based amounts
                            such as years, months, and days, while
                            <code>Duration</code> represents time-based amounts
                            such as seconds and nanoseconds.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- Q5 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#dateQuestionFive">

                            What is Instant?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionFive"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            <code>Instant</code> represents a point on the UTC
                            timeline and is useful for machine-oriented
                            timestamps.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- Q6 -->
                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
