                    </h2>

                    <div id="dateQuestionSeven"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#dateTimeQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            The main date and time value classes in
                            <code>java.time</code> are immutable. Operations
                            return new values instead of modifying existing
                            instances.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

