                <p class="mb-0">
                    Java's modern Date and Time API provides LocalDate,
                    LocalTime, LocalDateTime, ZonedDateTime, OffsetDateTime,
                    Instant, Period, Duration, ZoneId, Clock, and
                    DateTimeFormatter. These immutable types provide a
                    consistent way to work with dates, times, timestamps,
                    durations, and time zones.
                </p>

            </div>

